{"id":"sanctorale.03-14.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_mar#0314","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["14. März"],["Hl. Mathilde, Königin"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Als zweite Gemahlin Heinrichs I. und Urenkelin des Sachsenherzogs Widukind, im Kloster Herford erzogen, erschien sie schon den Zeitgenossen als “Frau von wunderbarer Heiligkeit”. Von den fünf Kindern wurde Otto Kaiser, Bruno Erzbischof von Köln und Heinrich Herzog von Bayern. Mehrere Stifte und Klöster haben die Heilige Mathilde zur Gründerin. Sie starb 968 in Quedlinburg und wurde in der dortigen Schlosskirche beigesetzt."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für heilige Frauen:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.holy-men-and-women.14"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.holy-men-and-women.15"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Gott, du liebst die Menschen, die Frieden stiften und barmherzig sind. Mit deiner Hilfe hat die heilige Königin Mathilde Streitende versöhnt und den Notleidenden geholfen. Schenke auch uns Güte und Geduld und mache uns zum Werkzeug deines Friedens. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"35","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"36","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Qui in Sanctórum concílio celebráris,...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Tu enim Sanctórum tuórum confessióne...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...Na assembleia dos Santos...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Pois, pelo testemunho admirável...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"SAINTS"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... For you are praised in the company...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... For in the marvellous confession of...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque eres glorificado en la asamblea...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque mediante el testimonio admirable de tus santos...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI SANTI"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nella festosa assemblea dei santi...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nella testimonianza di fede dei tuoi santi...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Saints"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Car tu es glorifié dans l'assemblée des saints...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Tu ne cesses de fortifier ton Église...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HEILIGEN"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Die Schar der Heiligen verkündet...","to":"preface.52"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Denn in den Heiligen schenkst du der Kirche...","to":"preface.53"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.52","preface.53"],"commons":["common.holy-men-and-women.14","common.holy-men-and-women.15"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Mathilde, Königin"}}
